  "notes": [
    "Colours are 16-bit RGB. Each colour lies outside the 255 ACI colours, so DXF must write group 420 or the nearest ACI index. rect-colour sets fill foreground and background to different colours. A solid fill draws one of them, and the export shows which. resource.class.attributes covers pen colour by class. rect-class-fill covers fill colour by class."
  ]
